==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zigge]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
** 1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
** 2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
** 3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is rushable. If you have Awakened Bahamut, use him for a free victory. If not, use any other cat that can deal enough damage to defeat the base.

